      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        295.5986328125,
        527.4234619140625,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "ART, the pooled sensitivity was 89.3% (95% CI 82.6 ; 93.6), and the specificity was 27.2% (95% CI 17.3 ;",
