        320.72259521484375,
        527.3416137695312,
        336.4416809082031
      ],
      "text": "(54,55) , the pooled sensitivity was higher (84.6%, 95% CI 69.7 ; 92.9), but the specificity was lower  ART",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.5182495117188,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "(29.8%, 95% CI 26.3 ; 33.6) than for the symptom screen alone. In all studies, the median prevalence of TB",
