      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        387.9986267089844,
        524.4622192382812,
        402.441650390625
      ],
      "text": "for pregnant women were found. The GDG agreed that, in adults and adolescents with HIV, the four-",
