      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        401.1986389160156,
        527.3455200195312,
        415.64166259765625
      ],
      "text": "symptom screen (current cough, fever, weight loss or night sweats) is useful for ruling out TB disease,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        414.3986511230469,
        527.4501953125,
        428.8416748046875
      ],
      "text": "regardless of ART use, although confirmation of TBI with IGRA, TST or TBST would be desirable before",
