      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        427.5986022949219,
        527.552978515625,
        442.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "starting TPT. It noted the potential benefits of adding normal CXR findings to the rule, while recognizing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992547035217285,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        440.7986145019531,
        527.4572143554688,
        455.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "that the improvement in performance was marginal. Moreover, increased use of CXR would add more",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        453.9986267089844,
        527.4465942382812,
        468.441650390625
      ],
      "text": "false-positive results to the screening rule, which would require more investigations for TB and other",
