      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        467.1986389160156,
        527.4214477539062,
        481.64166259765625
      ],
      "text": "illnesses. Therefore, the GDG reiterated that CXR may be added as an additional investigation only if it",
