      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        480.3986511230469,
        527.36962890625,
        494.8416748046875
      ],
      "text": "does not pose a barrier to the provision of preventive treatment for people with HIV. It should not be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        493.5986633300781,
        527.4448852539062,
        508.04168701171875
      ],
      "text": "a requirement for initiating TPT. Although no study was found of the effect of adding CXR in testing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        506.7987060546875,
        527.466064453125,
        521.24169921875
      ],
      "text": "pregnant women, the GDG noted that pregnant women with HIV could also benefit, as long as good",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        518.7225952148438,
        432.081787109375,
        534.441650390625
      ],
      "text": "(56) . practices are observed to prevent harmful exposure of the fetus to radiation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.7025146484375,
        527.2762451171875,
        556.1455078125
      ],
      "text": "In 2020, a systematic literature review and meta-analysis of individual data on patients were conducted",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961081504821777,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.902587890625,
        527.426513671875,
        569.3455810546875
      ],
      "text": "to assess further the accuracy of the WHO-recommended four-symptom screen (W4SS) of people",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.1026611328125,
        527.3905029296875,
        582.545654296875
      ],
      "text": "with HIV and of important subgroups and to identify other screening tools and strategies to increase",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        580.0264892578125,
        527.4336547851562,
        595.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "(13) detection of TB in people with HIV  . The screening tools and strategies reviewed by the GDG",
