      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.5026245117188,
        527.3828125,
        608.9456176757812
      ],
      "text": "included CRP, CXR and mWRD, as both stand-alone tests and in combination with the W4SS. Culture",
