      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        607.70263671875,
        437.9146728515625,
        622.1456298828125
      ],
      "text": "was the reference standard for assessing the accuracy of the screening strategies (",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988093376159668,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        438.0621032714844,
        607.70263671875,
        469.34759521484375,
        622.1456298828125
      ],
      "text": "Table 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988093376159668,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        469.3403015136719,
        607.70263671875,
        524.385986328125,
        622.1456298828125
      ],
      "text": "). The meta-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988093376159668,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        620.902587890625,
        527.4063720703125,
        635.3455810546875
      ],
      "text": "analysis of data on individual patients comprised 23 studies of 16 269 participants with HIV, in which",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        634.1024780273438,
        504.1562194824219,
        648.5454711914062
      ],
      "text": "the accuracy of the W4SS was reviewed. Most of the studies addressed pulmonary TB disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.8065185546875,
        527.619140625,
        670.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "The W4SS has suboptimal accuracy for some subgroups of people with HIV. The specificity is low,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.0064697265625,
        527.4155883789062,
        683.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "37–38%, among all people with HIV and even lower among people newly enrolled or not on ART.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        682.2064819335938,
        527.4103393554688,
        696.6494750976562
      ],
      "text": "Therefore, people who do not have TB disease are frequently screened as positive and are referred",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        695.406494140625,
        527.4267578125,
        709.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "unnecessarily for diagnostic evaluation. This reduces the efficiency of screening programmes (e.g. with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        708.6064453125,
        527.4335327148438,
        723.0494384765625
      ],
      "text": "higher costs for diagnostic testing) and slows initiation of TPT. The sensitivity of W4SS is also low (53%)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.8064575195312,
        527.4044799804688,
        736.2494506835938
      ],
      "text": "among people with HIV on ART; thus, almost half of prevalent TB cases are not identified in routine",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        735.0064697265625,
        527.4010620117188,
        749.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "symptom screening alone. In a setting in which the prevalence of TB is 1%, 742 of 1000 outpatients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        748.2064819335938,
        527.4229736328125,
        762.6494750976562
      ],
      "text": "screened with the W4SS and CRP would be true negatives and eligible for TPT, while only 416 would",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        761.406494140625,
        527.4750366210938,
        775.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "be found to be eligible with the W4SS alone. Restricted access to CRP or CXR should not be a barrier",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        774.6064453125,
        141.58253479003906,
        789.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "to initiating TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
